---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'June 2025';
const site = {
  name: 'Sunbloom Adorn',
  email: 'sunbloomadorn@gmail.com',
  phone: '+91 99522 53464',
  address: 'No. 15, Apple Garden, Coimbatore.',
  grievanceEmail: 'grievance@sunbloomadorn.com',
  grievanceName: 'Mr. Sunbloom Adorn',
  grievanceResponse: '48 hours',
};
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading tracking-tight text-gray-900 uppercase">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-8 md:p-10 prose prose-gray max-w-none">

        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          At {site.name}, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or make a purchase.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We collect the following types of information when you use our website:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, shipping address, and billing details provided at checkout.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Payment details are collected and processed by our payment gateway partner (Cashfree Payments). We do not store credit/debit card numbers or UPI credentials on our servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Order Information:</strong> Products purchased, order history, and communication preferences.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and browsing behaviour via cookies and similar technologies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We use the information we collect for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>To process and fulfil your orders (including payment processing through Cashfree, shipping, and delivery updates).</li>
          <li>To communicate with you regarding your order, account, or customer service inquiries.</li>
          <li>To improve our website, products, and customer experience.</li>
          <li>To send promotional offers and updates (only with your explicit consent).</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations and prevent fraudulent transactions.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">3. Consent</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          By using our website and providing your information, you <strong>explicitly consent</strong> to the collection, use, and sharing of your personal information as described in this Privacy Policy. Consent is obtained at the time of:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Account creation or checkout:</strong> You accept our Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy by checking the acceptance checkbox before completing a purchase.</li>
          <li><strong>Communication:</strong> You consent to receiving order-related communications (shipping updates, payment confirmations) automatically. Marketing communications require separate explicit opt-in consent.</li>
          <li><strong>Information sharing with Cashfree:</strong> By proceeding with payment, you consent to your payment details being shared with Cashfree Payments for transaction processing, fraud prevention, and regulatory compliance.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          You may withdraw consent at any time by contacting us, though this may affect our ability to provide certain services (e.g., order fulfilment).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We may share your information with trusted third parties only as necessary to provide our services:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Payment Gateway (Cashfree Payments):</strong> To process payments and prevent fraud, we share your name, email, phone number, and order amount with Cashfree Payments. Cashfree may collect and process your payment information (including card details, UPI ID, bank account info) in accordance with their privacy policy and RBI guidelines. We do <strong>not</strong> store any payment instrument details on our servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping Partners:</strong> To deliver your orders, we share your name, address, and phone number with courier services.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal & Regulatory Authorities:</strong> If required by law, court order, or to protect our rights, we may disclose information to government or law enforcement agencies. This includes sharing with RBI-mandated authorities and payment system operators for dispute resolution.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">5. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. All payment transactions are encrypted and processed securely through Cashfree's PCI-DSS compliant infrastructure.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We retain your personal information only as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes outlined in this policy, or as required by law. Order-related data is retained for record-keeping and legal compliance. You may request deletion of your data by contacting us.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          You have the right to:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Access the personal information we hold about you.</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your personal data (subject to legal obligations).</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time.</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with the relevant data protection authority.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">8. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Our website uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience, analyse site traffic, and understand where our visitors come from. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain features of our website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">9. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites (including Cashfree Payments). We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">11. Grievance Officer</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          In accordance with the Information Technology Act, 2000 and RBI guidelines, any complaints or grievances regarding the processing of your personal information may be addressed to our Grievance Officer:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-none pl-0 space-y-1 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Grievance Officer:</strong> {site.grievanceName}</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.grievanceEmail}`} class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-600">{site.grievanceEmail}</a></li>
          <li><strong>Response Time:</strong> We acknowledge complaints within {site.grievanceResponse} and aim to resolve them within 30 days.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">12. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed list-none pl-0 space-y-1 mt-2">
          <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-600">{site.email}</a></li>
          <li>Phone: {site.phone}</li>
          <li>Address: {site.address}</li>
          <li>Grievance Officer: <a href={`mailto:${site.grievanceEmail}`} class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-600">{site.grievanceEmail}</a></li>
          <li>Or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-600">Contact page</a>.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
